{"type":"message","id":"830bf882","parentId":"9cfc9ddb","timestamp":"2026-02-18T12:51:44.117Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Wed 2026-02-18 18:21 GMT+5:30] URGENT: Ensure OpenClaw gateway stays running when the laptop goes to sleep and wakes. Actions: 1) Identify the correct openclaw executable location (likely D:\\Software\\codex\\openclaw.mjs or similar). 2) Create/verify a Windows Service using NSSM that launches the gateway reliably (use the gateway-wrapper.bat we made or direct command). 3) Configure the service to start automatically on boot and restart on failure. 4) Optionally adjust Windows power settings to prevent aggressive sleep while the service is critical, or ensure the service restarts quickly after wake. 5) Test: put laptop to sleep, wake, verify gateway is running and WhatsApp reconnects. Report back with steps taken and any issues."}],"timestamp":1771419104114}}
